>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="5px" padding="0px">
    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;" color="#000000">
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 2px !important;">
    Hungary election tensions
  </h2>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Hungary election tensions"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>What’s happening? </strong>The war in Ukraine has become a <a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/crm8rxwyyz8o" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">central issue in Hungary’s upcoming parliamentary elections</a>, with PM Viktor Orbán accusing Kyiv of trying to undermine his government. Hungarian officials allege Ukraine could be preparing sabotage attacks and political interference to prevent Orbán’s Fidesz party from winning re-election. The dispute is tied partly to disruptions in the Druzhba oil pipeline following a Russian drone strike in western Ukraine, which halted oil deliveries to Hungary.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>Ukraine hysteria in Hungary: </strong>Tensions have fueled a wave of anti-Ukraine messaging across the country. Billboards and campaign materials portray Ukrainian President Zelenskyy as pressuring Europe for support, while linking him to opposition leader Péter Magyar of the Tisza Party. Government rallies warn Hungary could be dragged into the war, while the army has been deployed to patrol key energy facilities amid warnings of potential “hybrid attacks.”</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>Bigger picture: </strong>Critics say the government is exaggerating threats to influence voters. Analysts and independent journalists argue the pipeline outage stems from damage caused by Russian strikes rather than deliberate Ukrainian obstruction, while opposition figures accuse Orbán’s administration of spreading fear and disinformation ahead of the April election.</p>
</mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-section
      background-color="#eff1f4"
      css-class="border-line"
      padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
      border-radius="5px"
    >
      <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="5px" padding="0px">
        <!-- long stroy short content sections -->
        <mj-text
          padding="16px 12px 10px 12px"
          font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
          color="white"
        >
          <h2
            style="
              padding-bottom: 8px;
              color: #4d3060;
              text-align: left;
              border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;

              font-size: 26px;
              line-height: 1.2;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>The International Energy Agency is set to release 400mn barrels of oil from global strategic reserves to address the supply disruption triggered by the war in Iran.</strong> This move marks the largest such action in the organization’s history. The US will take a lead role by contributing 172mn barrels (<a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/03/11/iea-oil-reserves-crude-prices-iran-g7-energy.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">strategic oil release</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>The US has launched an investigation into unfair trade practices targeting major partners, including the EU, China, India, Japan, South Korea, and Mexico, under</strong> Section 301 powers that could lead to fresh import tariffs. The probe follows a US Supreme Court ruling that struck down key elements of President Trump’s earlier tariff policy. It aims to rebuild tariff authority before temporary global duties expire in July (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c15x1dxp3wpo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">tariff investigation</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>The Pentagon may allow limited continued use of Anthropic AI tools beyond a planned six-month phase-out if deemed vital to national security,</strong> according to an internal memo. Exemptions would apply only in “rare and extraordinary” cases, requiring units to submit detailed risk-mitigation plans while the broader ban on the firm’s technology remains in place (<a href="https://app.piqsuite.com/?widget-article=pentagon-opens-door-to-exempt-anthropic-use-beyond-6-month-ramp-down-memo-says-2026-03-11-22-29-39" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">exemption window</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Nissan Motor, Uber Technologies, and British startup Wayve have unveiled a partnership to develop robotaxis, </strong>targeting a pilot launch in Tokyo by late 2026. The service will use Nissan Leaf electric vehicles fitted with Wayve’s self-driving technology and operate via Uber’s platform. Initial rides will include safety drivers via a licensed taxi partner (<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/news/nissan-uber-wayve-announce-robotaxi-011834873.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">robotaxi trio</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>UK regulators Ofcom and the ICO demanded that Meta, TikTok, Snap, and YouTube strengthen age checks</strong> to block children under 13 and under-16s from accessing harmful content, in line with the Online Safety Act. Platforms must detail plans by April 30 to improve verification, ensure safer feeds, and restrict interactions with strangers, or face fines of up to 10% of their global revenue amid concerns about addictive algorithms (<a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/world/story/uk-watchdogs-press-meta-tiktok-snapchat-youtube-to-block-children-2880679-2026-03-12" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">UK child safety</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>WordPress launched my.WordPress.net, enabling full site setup and publishing directly in any web browser without hosting or domains</strong>. Private by default and browser-bound, it serves as a personal workspace for writing, journaling, and tools, with an App Catalog and AI integration powered by WordPress Playground. Users can export to public hosts; storage starts at 100MB with easy resets (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/11/wordpress-debuts-a-private-workspace-that-runs-in-your-browser-via-a-new-service-my-wordpress-net/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">private WordPress</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Researchers have developed an experimental cellular immunotherapy that may treat Alzheimer’s disease with a single injection.</strong> The therapy engineers brain cells called astrocytes with a CAR (chimeric antigen receptor) so they can detect and remove harmful amyloid beta plaques, a key driver of the disease. In mouse studies, the treatment prevented plaque formation when administered early and reduced existing amyloid levels by about 50% (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260311004720.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">cell therapy</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Jeffrey Epstein’s longtime accountant faced hours of closed-door questioning by the House Oversight Committee (<a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/03/11/politics/richard-kahn-epstein-accountant-house-deposition" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Epstein probe hearing</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Team USA stands on the brink of a shocking World Baseball Classic exit (<a href="https://www.si.com/mlb/team-usa-baseball-dream-team-italy-loss-brink-of-nightmarish-exit-world-baseball-classic" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">embarrassing exit</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">An explorer confirmed long-rumored “ghost elephants” living deep in Angola (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/science/ghost-elephants-angola-steve-boyes-werner-herzog-interview-spc-c2e" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">elephant rediscovery</a>).</p>
